<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool details crop quality on Nov 1.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool details crop quality on Nov 1.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool on Friday detailed the quality of its crops.</p>
<p>CROP	    GRADE	(PCT)</p>
<p>Wheat	   1996     10-yr avg</p>
<p>No1 CWRS	28	    29</p>
<p>No2 CWRS	 7	    24</p>
<p>No3 CWRS	39	    30</p>
<p>CW Feed	 26	    16</p>
<p>Barley</p>
<p>Malt	    20	    13</p>
<p>No1 CW	  65	    71</p>
<p>No2 CW	  15	    16</p>
<p>Canola</p>
<p>No1 C	   84	    72</p>
<p>No2 C	   13	    17</p>
<p>No3 C	    2	     7</p>
<p>Sample	   1	     4</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
